<title>USA: World Airways Oct total block hours up.</title>
<headline>World Airways Oct total block hours up.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>World Airways Inc said on Thursday it recorded a total of 4,208 block hours flown in October, up from 3,194 a year ago.</p>
<p>The company said it recorded a total of 42,067 block hours flown for the year-to-date, compared with 31,217 block hours for the same period last year.</p>
